        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, there are no naive, sweet girls. You’ll need real charm and skills to win a girl’s heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Are you struggling with romance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Are you frustrated by failed relationships?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Have you wasted money on expensive &quot;pickup artist&quot; guides?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those beautiful, unpredictable, emotion-driven women—experienced, treating love like a game—always keep you guessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe all you need is one crucial experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game won’t spoon-feed you answers, but if you play to the end, you’ll gain valuable dating insights—potentially saving you time and boosting your real-life success rate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Decrypt, battle, and conquer—this game offers a perfect blend of challenge and fun! (Warning: not for casual couch potatoes!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Grab your mouse, click &amp; drag like a pro, and show off your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Multiple save slots – More than one ending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Check the forum for game guides/walkthroughs.</i></h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, there are no naive, sweet girls. You’ll need real charm and skills to win a girl’s heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Are you struggling with romance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Are you frustrated by failed relationships?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Have you wasted money on expensive &quot;pickup artist&quot; guides?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those beautiful, unpredictable, emotion-driven women—experienced, treating love like a game—always keep you guessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe all you need is one crucial experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game won’t spoon-feed you answers, but if you play to the end, you’ll gain valuable dating insights—potentially saving you time and boosting your real-life success rate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Decrypt, battle, and conquer—this game offers a perfect blend of challenge and fun! (Warning: not for casual couch potatoes!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Grab your mouse, click &amp; drag like a pro, and show off your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Multiple save slots – More than one ending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Check the forum for game guides/walkthroughs.</i></h2>",
